subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Cancel a subscription with a guided checklist

USAGE:
  subtrack cancel <OPTIONS> <id>

ARGUMENTS:
  id           Subscription ID to cancel

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version
  -f, --force            Skip the checklist and cancel immediately
  -j, --json             Output subscription info as JSON (no changes)

